#   formatting_context_4 - Layout::FormattingContext: laying out absolutely positioned boxes,
#                          anchor insets and relative position insets
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FormattingContext.cpp (lines 1386-1870): the resolution of
#       anchor() in inset properties (css-anchor-position-1), the layout of the absolutely
#       positioned children of a formatting context's root (sizes before and after inside
#       layout, alignment, the used offset), the height of absolutely positioned replaced
#       boxes (CSS 2.2 §10.6.5) and the insets of relatively positioned boxes.
